flowchart TB
    Internet[Browser / Internet]
    subgraph Host["Single Docker Compose host - declared topology"]
        Caddy[Caddy :80 default; hostname enables automatic HTTPS]
        Web[Next.js web loopback :3000]
        API[Go API loopback :8080]
        Worker[Go worker loopback :9091 metrics]
        Migrate[One-shot migration container]
        PG[(PostgreSQL 16 loopback :5432)]
        Redis[(Redis 7 loopback :6379)]
        NATS[(NATS 2.10 JetStream loopback :4222 / 8222)]
        Stalwart[Stalwart latest :25 / 465 / 587; admin loopback :8081]
        Minio[(MinIO loopback :9000 / 9001)]
        Prom[Prometheus loopback :9090]
        Grafana[Grafana loopback :3001]
        Loki[Loki loopback :3100]
    end
    MX[External recipient MX]

    Internet --> Caddy
    Caddy -->|web fallback| Web
    Caddy -->|/api/* and /t/*| API
    Web -->|API URL passed as Next.js build argument| API
    Migrate --> PG
    API --> PG
    Worker --> PG
    API --> NATS
    Worker --> NATS
    API -.->|Redis URL declared; no Go client| Redis
    Worker -.->|Redis URL declared; no Go client| Redis
    Web -.->|MinIO declared; no app client| Minio
    Worker --> Stalwart --> MX
    Prom --> API
    Prom --> Worker
    Grafana --> Prom
    Grafana --> Loki

    Migrate -.->|Compose dependency: must exit successfully| API
    Migrate -.->|Compose dependency: must exit successfully| Worker
    classDef issue fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#a00,color:#333;
    classDef declared fill:#eee,stroke:#777,stroke-dasharray: 4 4,color:#333;
